        "trs": "Yes, when the world ends later, therefore we will revive, we with our bodies, then He will judge us, (and) send the good, lift (them) to heaven, because he (they) followed his commands, and He will drop (release outward) the bad into hell, because he (they) did not do what He and the church ordered us to.",
